OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 5 MAR
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,8,     GThe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,9,     GWales and Ryan Bancroft perform
OL,10,     GHillborg's Exquisite Corpse,
OL,11,     GShostakovich's 2nd Cello Concerto
OL,12,     Gwith Alban Gerhardt and
OL,13,     GSibelius's Lemminkainen Suite.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: You, Me and the
OL,15,     FWireless
OL,16,     GLegendary broadcaster Gillian
OL,17,     GReynolds shares her life and
OL,18,     Gcareer in radio, spanning over 50
OL,19,     Gyears. The role of politics on
OL,20,     Gair is her theme in this essay.
